WEBVTT

00:22:59.542 --> 00:23:03.893
For years, I've sent my students out
to negotiate something non-negotiable.

00:23:03.917 --> 00:23:07.184
They have to go into a retail setting
and try to get something free,

00:23:07.208 --> 00:23:10.018
and they can't mention
it's a class assignment.

00:23:10.042 --> 00:23:12.309
I want them to get
in the habit of negotiating

00:23:12.333 --> 00:23:14.934
and flexing their creative muscles,

00:23:14.958 --> 00:23:19.643
but one day, they turned the tables
and challenged me to do it myself.

00:23:19.667 --> 00:23:22.393
I failed to negotiate my way out of it,

00:23:22.417 --> 00:23:24.417
so I found myself heading to the mall.

00:23:25.333 --> 00:23:27.434
My wife likes Cinnabon and tacos,

00:23:27.458 --> 00:23:30.393
so I was hoping to surprise her
with something creative.